msgstr "Oft de útfier fan Nurevo AEO oan stiet, hokker útfier aktyf is (JSON-LD, llms.txt, robots.txt-regels), de kar foar AI-trainingscrawlers, oft de side mei nurevo.jp ferbûn is, it plan en oft der tastimming foar de diagnoaze jûn is."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5531
msgid "Which plugin outputs each schema type"
msgstr "Hokker plugin elk schema-type útjout"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3915
msgid "With the site connected, the plugin also sends a record of changes to its own settings: which outputs were switched on or off, which business fields were filled in or cleared (not what was entered), the site type, the SEO plugin in use, the plugin version and the number of FAQ entries, services and products. Nurevo uses these records together with AI search measurements, in aggregate across sites, to learn which changes help businesses appear in AI answers."
msgstr "Salang't de side keppele is, stjoert de plugin ek in oersjoch fan feroarings yn syn eigen ynstellings: hokker útfier oan- of útset is, hokker bedriuwsfjilden ynfolle of leechmakke binne (net wat der ynfolle is), it sidetype, de brûkte SEO-plugin, de pluginferzje en it tal faak stelde fragen, tsjinsten en produkten. Nurevo brûkt dizze gegevens tegearre mei mjittings yn AI-sykjen, gearfoege oer siden, om te learen hokker feroarings bedriuwen helpe om yn AI-antwurden te ferskinen."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/includes/setup-wizard.php:783
